    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:fb5db666cae6efb7",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "0f22cda0c285e2dff2d8c17a6123fd5926e49bc7cd02ba9200d0dce832306a27",
      "text": "Days 8–11 · A former fishing village about 170 km east of Rio, Búzios has an intimate feel, a mild climate, exotic vegetation and picture-perfect beaches, with golden sands, crystal-clear water, green hills, rocky cliffs and beautiful sunsets. Besides relaxing by the sea, surfing, scuba diving, water-skiing and kayaking are popular; a boat trip with a local fisherman reveals turtles, tropical fish and, in season, even whales. In the evening, chic restaurants and stylish bars open their doors along the cobbled streets: the perfect family spot to unwind after your Brazilian journey.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1Wg4CyjW-F-4jP-6VYSBThNCA6HQv8N6s",
